- Workers execute the claimed subtask and report; they do not schedule, evaluate dependencies, finalize, claim, or change ownership.
- `Task.state_lock` never held across specialist/tool/model/filesystem/network execution or while waiting on the completion queue. Lock order stays Task lock â†’ TaskStore lock.
